## Code Style Rules

- **TypeScript strict mode on.** No `any`. Define types for all API responses in lib/types/.
- **Server components by default.** Use `'use client'` only when you need browser APIs,
  event handlers, or React hooks. Data fetching in server components where possible.
- **No hardcoded colors.** Use Tailwind semantic classes or the risk-band utility
  (lib/utils/risk-band.ts) which maps scores to color classes.
- **No inline styles.** Tailwind only.
- **All API functions in lib/api/.** No direct axios calls from components.
- **All data fetching via TanStack Query hooks.** No useEffect + fetch patterns.
- **Loading states required.** Every page that fetches data must handle loading and
  error states using the shared EmptyState and ErrorState components.
- **Pagination is server-side.** Never fetch all rows and paginate client-side.
- **Dates always formatted via lib/utils/format.ts.** Never inline date formatting.
- **Supply chain stage always displayed as a badge**, never raw string.
  Mapping: oem→"OEM", cell_maker→"Cell Maker", miner→"Miner",
  refiner→"Refiner", recycler→"Recycler", holding→"Holding"

